        "TileImage": "$($repository 6dfe141c-fa3b-422a-a28e-3ce2af1069ed).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Olivia Hall has identified three suspected Nazi operatives hidden within the Carlisle Family at Thornbridge Manor in Dartmoor. Their English aliases are Ray Gibson, Elaine Sutton, and Jane Moss. The manor, former home of a British soldier killed on Utah Beach and sold post-war to Thomas Alexander Carlisle, now conceals these fugitives. Infiltrate, observe, and eliminate all three targets. Olivia will upload further profiles to your dossier. Discretion is essential. Good Luck 47",
